  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leave No Child Out - Building Inclusive, Equitable and Quality Education in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed partnership project aims to enhance the inclusive education system in Georgia to provide all children, especially children with special educational needs and disabilities with enabling learning environments and opportunities to best achieve their potential. Children between 3 &#x2013; 18 years of age, with a specific focus on CWD, national minorities and marginalised children including children who are currently not attending school and are at risk of dropping out.</narrative>
  </description>
